{"version":1,"content":"<p>央視主辦的首屆「世界機械人登泰山大賽」周一（2日）在山東泰安舉行，設足式機械人競速及負重等賽項，近90支隊伍在全長約3.9公里、共3100多級石階的泰山盤道同場競技，結果由北京「靈翌科技隊」以43分41秒奪得足式機械人競速賽冠軍。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:04.535749+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:31:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.043456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:09.058597+00:00","content_hash":"b67d53043aeeb5d09b1949bc0ceb761b7ef37f697d28e1d8af4c28c8aea0dbdf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}